        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Daudi mukdá' sleémeero aa burumburiit guri báy, «Garmaaeé' Solomon an heé taa tsawaár nee Mungú, ala inós ku niiná, aa kwa/iiká baraá gadiyeérihe. Gadiyeérí ka ló'wa ur, asma doó ta tlehhitaan a doó heewooká, ala a Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng umuú gaaro aga iiár burumburto as tleehhamór doó Munguúeé', muruú naa burumbuúr a kwí: Sahaábu as muruú ta sahaábúr tleehhi, nee muqslár peésa ar ta muruú muqslár peésár ar tleehhi, nee muqsla sirda/aten ar ta muruú muqslár sirda/atén ar tleehhi, nee muqsla ar ta xoslár muqslár ar tleehhi, nee xaai awa ta xooslár xaaír tleehhi. Sleeme tlaa/aá kal'i iga amohhe'eés nee tlaa/aá tar tipin, tlaa/aá ta bay njumu, tlaa/eedá' kal'i nee awa tlaxo uren awa da'aweemaá dimbadiimbé, nee awa ta bay marumarúr yaariir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dinkwa nee tí sleémeero naa haniisi as do'owí hhoohhoó', aníng sahaábu u koóm nee muqslár peesaaro. As doó Munguúeé' nguwa slaa', muruuwí an kwe'eé' nu kilá', aníng un haniisi as doó Munguúeé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng talaántár kume tám ar sahaábuú Ofirír daáhh aga haniís, nee talaántár tsiire tám ar muqslár peésa ar ta koo/ír ar ninkiriitsi ana haniís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sahaábu una amohhe'eés as xooslár sahaábu, nee muqslár peésa as xooslaá peésa, nee muruú ta qoo tleehhi ar daba' nee heé gadiyeé ga xuú'. Xáy, a heemá heé ti kilós haniís laarí as tawa oo AAKOÓ MUNGÚ?»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy, múk urén oo maraá baabi'i, nee geeraharuusér tlahhi'i, nee geeraharuusér slaqwaruusér kume nee ar tsiire, nee kudaá geeraharuusér sagadiyuusér doó waawutmoó sagesihhmiitá', muruuín ngway haniisiyé' ar sla'aari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muruú taa haniís as gadiyér doó Mungú a gunyadaá sahaábu awa kumuú wák nee tsiire tsiyáhh, nee muqslár sirda/aten a guniyadu kume lahhoó' nee tsiire tsár, muqsla a guniyadu kume mibeeri tám nee tsiyáhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukdá' tlaa/aá tlaxo uren gi koóm kiri hanmiís dír heedaádá' ohmér babaáts ar doó Mungú, kudá' ta bay Yehieli, heé tlahhoó Gershoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo muu iri ló'wa qwalalaá/ as adoodá' muruuín nguwa hanmisiyé' ar muunuú /awaák, asma muruuín sleémeero nguna dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i hanisiyé' ar muner'ín sleémeero ar muunuú /awaák. Waawutmo Daudi sleeme iri ló'wa qwalaá/.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Daudi AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gway diidi'iís dír geeraá muu sleémeero wa ale, iwa kaahi, «Aá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú taati'iirén awa Israeli, kuúng tu diidi'iimaamisi ay alhhe'eesay wasle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, uraay a kók nee /uuru nee xirif nee baaliro nee aleesleemuuwo. Asma umuú gaaro ar gawaá dooriwo, laqaá ar baraá yaamu a tók. Waawuti'iima a tók, kuúng taa xirfayeés nee tu úr dír umuú gaaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaari'iima nee ilaiwa/ame amór i dahh a amoorók, kuúng umuú gaaro an sawaawuti'iín, aleesleemu nee /uuru i gawaá dabaawók, kuúng aleesleemu u koón oo umuú heewo kuwa ures nee kuwa /uurií dok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daxta Munguúrén, atén kuúng u sluufisaán nee umuuwók u xirfayeemisaán.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ala aníng a gár milá, nee tam muk'eé' sleeme a gár milá, tam atén muruuwí nguri aleeslawaán haniisaro ar muunuú /awaák, asma umuú gaaro amoorók ngin dáhh, baraá muruuwí amoorók dahha, atén kuúng una muruuwí hanisaán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma atén a adór dahaaye nee múk waaraáhh geeraawoge ar adoodár baabi'iirén sleémeero. Deelór hotaarén baraakaá yaamuwo a adór mahhtuú waaraáhh, harahhifór hota i káhh baraakae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúrén, atén daqaari'iimarén ar yaariir ngaa dinkwár i huwaán as Do'ók kuwa tleehhaan as ilaiwa/amér umuuwók kudá' hhoohhoó', ala tí sleémeero amór i dahh a amoorók, nee sleémeero a tók. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng aga xuú' adór kuúng Munguúeé' muu kur mune tsee/aariín, nee an qwalaalá/ as múk ganaá'. Aníng baraá gan'amuú muunaáeene muruuwí sleémeero nguna haniís ar muunuú /awaák, nee aníng daxta aga ár adór mukwí diirí dirií' kuúng tura ilahhooárí haniís ar muunuú /awaák nee ar qwala/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú baabi'iirén, Abrahamu nee Isaka nee Yakobo, adoorí mukók aa tleéhh tsuuqeek, nee munér inkihhimuú koom i kumaamit, nee munér mukók amoorók xu'usek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Garmaaeé' Solomon tsuuqeek, as kahhó' hara'ayarók ngiwa oohi ar muunaáwós sleémeero, nee dabeeroge nee kaahiroge, sleémeero ngi boo/eesi, as do'owí aníng naa xoslu amohhe'eés nguwa aleeslay tleehhamooro.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi muu sleémeero gway báy, «Gimsé', AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng diidi'iisaak.» Mukdaádá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguú baabi'ii'ín ngway diidi'iisiyé', sager'ín ngiri xupu'usiyé', Mungú nguri sluufisiyé', AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nguri ilaiwawa/iyé' nee waawutmoowo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál tsare ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i ngay haniisár ayé' dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. Awér kumuú wák kari tsuú/ as ilahhooa nee gwaandawér kumuú wák nee deeloó bee/aangw oo kumuú wák, kuká' sleémeero kina daá/ baraá kitangwdá' ilahhooa kawa hanmamiisi, sleeme ilahhooár muruú wahaangw oo difaái nguna huwiyé', nee ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i ar yaariir kay haniís as múk Israeli sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalarihe tana /ayín nee tari wahán ar qwal/aamaye dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wa ale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon ngway iimbalaaxiyé' ar di/i sagá wa tsare ar umuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ as tawa waawutmooín, nee Sadoki tawa kaahamusmoó Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Solomon kitangwduú waawuti'iima oo AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gway óh daanduú baabuúwós Daudi wa alé. Inós an waawutmoó ado gaa aleeslay nee múk Israeli sleémeero iri iialooeés dirose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeraharuuse sleémeero nee miguuseero nee daaqoó Daudi sleémeero al'axweesani ngiri ooiyé' dír waawutmo Solomon ar nguwa ilaiwawa/iya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Solomon gway iia tleereés ta waawituú hatlá' aa giirin ba/a baraá yaamaá Israeliro, gway diihhooárií haniís waawituú hatlá' ba/a kudá' tlahh'aá Israeli gaa sawaawuti'ini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Daudi garmoó Yese múk Israeli sleémeero guna sawaawuti'ín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós múk Israeli guna sawaawuti'ín kureeri mibeeri tsiyáhh, baraá yaamaá Hebroniro kureeri ngaa /aáy faanqw, baraá yaamaá Yerusalemuro kureeri ngaa /aáy mibeeri tám nee tám. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós iwa gwaá' a aakoó aa dimaay hhe'ees, a daqaarmo nee a heé ta ilaiwawa/i. Garmaawós Solomon kitaangós oo waawuti'iima guna óh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwaynaá daanduú waawutmo Daudi imiír iimu/úngw wa tleemu ay alhhe'eesáy kaa gooín baraá kitaábuú inslaslaangw oo iigu'utusmo Samueli nee oo aarusmo Natani nee oo iigu'utusmo Gadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitaabi'iidá' kángw waawuti'iimarós ngu kaahiyá' nee /uuruuwose, nee muruú inós gwaa slayi nee xoorór Israeliro, nee waawuti'iima sleémeero baraá yaamuwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
